---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mastery Tutor Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the Mastery Tutor app and Tutor State Engine."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Mastery Tutor Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective:</strong> September 4, 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Mastery Tutor is an educational workflow. Its optional v0.8.0 Tutor State Engine is a stateless,
      read-only MCP service used to recommend the next pedagogical mode for a lesson.
    </p>

    <h2>Information processed</h2>
    <p>
      When the Tutor State Engine is invoked, it is designed to receive only compact structured lesson state:
      a short learning goal or topic, learner-level category, current lesson stage, last-result category,
      current support level, a small stall counter, and whether the interaction is a review context.
    </p>
    <p>
      The tool is explicitly designed not to require a raw conversation transcript, passwords, access tokens,
      account identifiers, or unrelated personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Storage and retention</h2>
    <p>
      The Mastery Tutor application code does not write tool inputs or outputs to a database, Cloudflare KV,
      Durable Objects, R2, Analytics Engine, or another application-level persistent store. It does not maintain
      a user account or persistent learner profile.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cloudflare may process standard network, security, and operational metadata as the infrastructure provider.
      OpenAI may process information according to the ChatGPT service and app privacy terms applicable to the user.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and authentication</h2>
    <p>The v0.8.0 Tutor State Engine does not require login, OAuth, or application cookies.</p>

    <h2>Sharing and sale</h2>
    <p>
      Mastery Tutor does not sell personal information. The service does not intentionally disclose lesson-state
      payloads to advertising networks or data brokers. Infrastructure processing by OpenAI and Cloudflare is
      subject to their respective policies and service terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      The MCP service is deployed over HTTPS and exposes read-only deterministic tutoring-state advice. No external
      write action is provided by v0.8.0.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>This policy may be updated when the app's data practices or platform requirements change.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, open an issue in the
      <a href="https://github.com/oozoofrog/mastery-tutor/issues">Mastery Tutor GitHub repository</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="back"><a href="/mastery-tutor/">← Mastery Tutor</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 4rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  h1, h2 { color: var(--dark-green); }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .back { margin-top: 3rem; }
</style>
